 The backend server will be available at `http://localhost:8000`.
+
+## Backend regression tests
+
+From `backend`, run `make test` (or `uv run python -B -m unittest discover -s tests -v`).
+The lifecycle tests use temporary SQLite databases and deterministic local node
+replacements; they do not call model APIs. They cover completion, early stream
+closure, errors, cancellation, and interrupt/resume persistence.
